        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Everything of importance has been said before by somebody who did not discover it.\n—ALFRED NORTH WHITEHEAD",
            "block_bbox": [
                225,
                482,
                626,
                555
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 1,
            "global_block_id": 1,
            "global_group_id": 1,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    225.0,
                    482.0
                ],
                [
                    626.0,
                    482.0
                ],
                [
                    626.0,
                    555.0
                ],
                [
                    225.0,
                    555.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Few writers can get by on their own thoughts alone, and researchers never can. We all write better when our thinking is enriched by what we learn from others. There are rules for using the words and ideas of others, and your first obligation is to understand and follow them. Mistakes here can damage your credibility, your grade, and even your reputation for honesty.",
            "block_bbox": [
                78,
                582,
                772,
                710
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "global_block_id": 2,
            "global_group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    78.0,
                    582.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    582.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    710.0
                ],
                [
                    78.0,
                    710.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "But as with other aspects of style, you also have choices, and this lesson, like our others, focuses not just on what you must do to use sources properly but on what you can do to use them effectively.",
            "block_bbox": [
                78,
                712,
                772,
                789
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "global_block_id": 3,
            "global_group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    78.0,
